WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.690
A loom clacks.

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.700
Two threads run through
it, one gold, one dark.

3
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.500
Gold is Silas Marner, the weaver.

4
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.700
Dark is the Cass family.

5
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.540
Again and again, the threads cross.

6
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.570
Then the calendar riffles.

7
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:20.850
Part Two opens 16 years later,
on "a bright autumn Sunday".

8
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.130
Sixteen years, gone in one page turn.

9
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.230
Why leap over all that time?

10
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.040
In this mission, you'll
map the novel's two parts,

11
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.620
either side of the gap.

12
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:35.370
You'll follow the two plots, as his
history becomes "blent in a singular manner

13
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.210
with the life of his neighbours".

14
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.180
And you'll read the
first lines of Part Two.

15
00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: work out why
the novel jumps sixteen years.
